      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not too familiar with AVRCP specs, but does this `scope` check change the behavior, or is it part of the \"strengthening\" of our code?\n\nIn the original code in `notifyChanged`, `service.notifyChildrenChanged` is called as long as `node.getScope() !\u003d BROWSE_SCOPE_NOW_PLAYING`.\n\nNow, an extra check against `BROWSE_SCOPE_VFS` and `BROWSE_SCOPE_PLAYER_LIST` is being added.",
